            ```
            Identity-domain sign-in: the user's email (Map Additional User Attributes To of APEX_FA_IABWBN-DEV1_OAUTH).
            ```
    }
)

appItem G_ADMIN_APP (
    scope: app
    security {
        sessionStateProtection: unrestricted
    }
    comments {
        comments:
            ```
            Application (code) the COMMON setup screens work for: ALL (every application), or the application that opened a setup screen for itself (page 99, G_ADMIN_LOCK = Y).
            ```
    }
)

appItem G_ADMIN_LOCK (
    scope: app
    security {
        sessionStateProtection: unrestricted
    }
    comments {
        comments:
            ```
            Y when another application opened a COMMON setup screen for its own application (G_ADMIN_APP): delegated mode.
            ```
    }
)


appItem NOTIFY_COUNT (
    scope: app
    security {
        sessionStateProtection: restricted
    }
    comments {
        comments:
            ```
            Release 84: the signed-in person's unread notifications (the badge of the bell in the navigation bar); empty when none.
            ```
    }
)


appItem G_APP_TITLE (
    scope: app
    security {
        sessionStateProtection: restricted
    }
    comments {
        comments:
            ```
            Release 97: the name at the top of the page - COMMON's name, or on My Tasks (40) the application the user came from.
            ```
    }
)


appItem G_FROM_APP_NAME (
    scope: app
    security {
        sessionStateProtection: restricted
    }
    comments {
        comments:
            ```
            Release 97: the application My Tasks (40) was opened from (read from the referring page); empty when opened in COMMON.
            ```
    }
)


appItem G_HOME_URL (
    scope: app
    security {
        sessionStateProtection: restricted
    }
    comments {
        comments:
            ```
            Release 97: the Home link of My Tasks (40) - the home page of the application it was opened from, else COMMON Home.
            ```
    }
)


appItem G_RETURN_APP (
    scope: app
    security {
        sessionStateProtection: restricted
    }
    comments {
        comments:
            ```
            Release 99: the application (alias) the shared login page was opened for; COMMON Home sends the user to its home page once after the sign-in.
            ```
    }
)


appItem G_USER_HOME_URL (
    scope: app
    security {
        sessionStateProtection: restricted
    }
    comments {
        comments:
            ```
            Release 103: the user's Home (process USER_HOME, once per session) - COMMON Home for a user who may open it, else the home page of the user's application (XXFND_USER_PKG.HOME_APPLICATION), else My Tasks.
            ```
    }
)


appItem G_USER_APP_NAME (
    scope: app
    security {
        sessionStateProtection: restricted
    }
    comments {
        comments:
            ```
            Release 103: the name of the user's application when the user may not open COMMON Home (the name at the top of COMMON's shared pages); empty for COMMON users.
            ```
    }
)


appItem G_WORK_APP (
    scope: app
    security {
        sessionStateProtection: restricted
    }
    comments {
        comments:
            ```
            Release 104: the application (alias) a COMMON page is used from - set by process WORK_APP from the referring page, kept while the user stays on COMMON pages, cleared on COMMON Home; a user who may not open COMMON Home always works in the own application. Its menu, name and Home are shown (XXFND_NAV_MENU_V).
            ```
    }
)
